Z||000004||theogre||12-17-2001||07:32 PM||||Check autozone.com partsamerica.com and local parts stores before fiero store.<P>autozone 86 Fiero V6<BR>Pioneer DA-1731 (replaces OE# 14083394) 73.99<BR>Pioneer DA-1733 (replaces OE# 14085401) 67.99<BR>1 year warranty on them. Autozone only sells new balancers.<P>They are listed instock online or special order at the store. From past business at the zone, the stores usually take 1-3 business days for specail order parts. <P>which one is on your car? I don't know. It may be stamped into the thing someplace. I'm sure one of the people who work on V6 more knows.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/fullstaff.gif">  <FONT COLOR="blue"><I><B>11-Sept-01, The day the world as we knew it ended.</B></I></FONT>||||reg||1
